  %p
    I'm a front-end engineer based in Barcelona. I've spent most of my career somewhere between design, code and product — building things for the web, figuring out how they should work, and occasionally questioning whether they need to exist in the first place.

  %p
    I currently work at <a href="https://newrelic.com/">New Relic</a>, focusing on design systems and front-end engineering. Before that, I co-founded <a href="https://swwweet.com/">Swwweet</a>, a small web studio, and spent several years teaching web development.

  %p
    You can find more about my professional experience on <a href="https://es.linkedin.com/in/javier-usobiaga">LinkedIn</a>, see some of my code on <a href="https://github.com/htmlboy">GitHub</a>, or drop me a line at <a href="mailto:hola@javierusobiaga.com">hola@javierusobiaga.com</a>.
